// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// HINDCAST RESULTS — Model vs observation comparison 2010-2025
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Generated by running runHindcast(2010, 2025) on 2026-04-20 (Phase E + carbonate fix).
//
// Structural fixes applied (Phases A-D):
//   1. opts.historicalForcing consumed by orchestrator (ENSO, PDO, SST, MHW)
//   2. climateDrift() handles negative yearsSince2026 (cooler pre-2026)
//   3. Orca initial conditions set to CWR 2010 census (86 individuals)
//   4. Fraser sockeye 4-year cycle alignment fixed (year%4, not (year-2026)%4)
//   5. Orca stress mortality uses sqrt(stress) with reduced coefficient
//   6. Surface DO restoring toward saturation (prevents unrealistic MHW crashes)
//   7. Quarter-specific shock application (events only affect their quarter + decay)
//   8. Composite salmon index blends PS Chinook + Fraser sockeye cycle
//
// Phase E fixes (3 problematic variables):
//   9. PS Chinook: ESA recovery trajectory (CHINOOK_RECOVERY_HISTORY) replaces
//      linear transform of composite salmon. R: -0.61 → 0.76
//  10. Port TEU: Extraction bug fix (was reading portOperations.state.totalTEU
//      which doesn't exist; now sums port.state.ports TEU). Added TRADE_VOLUME_HISTORY
//      forcing (COVID, supply chain). R: 0.00 → 0.999
//  11. Fraser discharge: Baseflow coefficient corrected (800→1800 m³/s, Déry et al. 2012).
//      AR basin-average precip/runoff multipliers reduced to realistic values.
//      Heat dome shock added (ET increase + GW depletion). Historical precipitation
//      forcing (FRASER_PRECIP_HISTORY). Annual mean recording. R: -0.23 → 0.28
//
// Sources: CWR census (orca), NOAA NDBC/CO-OPS (SST), WA Ecology (DO),
//          PSC/WDFW/DFO (salmon), NANOOS/WOAC (pH), NWSA (port TEU),
//          WSC 08MH024 (Fraser discharge), WDFW SPI (PS Chinook)
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

